This repository contains documentation for the AS Authenticator browser
extension: the user guide, screenshots, the vault file format description,
the changelog, and the privacy and security policies. It does not contain
the extension's source code, which is not published.

You may read, link to and quote this documentation. No other rights are
granted. The AS Authenticator name and icon are property of Ayala Solutions.

The vault file format is described in docs/ so that other software can read
and write vault files; describing or implementing the format is permitted.
